<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">近来我的心潮迷失在茫茫海洋</text><text for="L2">七十亿人浮游世间 而我只是在机械地过活</text><text for="L3">我燃起求救的信号 只盼爱与真心相守</text><text for="L4">我把心意交给陌生面孔 换来的却是空洞念想</text><text for="L5">或许我该试着找回从前的自己</text><text for="L6">带我回到那些熟悉之地 回到懂我的人身边</text><text for="L7">我只想与人相连 也许你能为我指引</text><text for="L8">若身边人潮如此汹涌 为何我仍孤独难当</text><text for="L9">能否寻得一份心灵相契</text><text for="L10">能否 能否让我与谁真正相连 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(孤单)</span></text><text for="L11">能否觅得一份心灵相通</text><text for="L12">能否 能否找到彼此相知的人</text><text for="L13">真心相待的朋友实在难寻 不如直面现实</text><text for="L14">买下梦寐以求的家 地下室却遭了水患</text><text for="L15">如今挣了些钱 我也不想再追逐更多</text><text for="L16">俄克拉荷马来的我们 可不想虚度此生</text><text for="L17">我只想为自己描绘一幅人生图景</text><text for="L18">找一件或许四十年后仍值得我在意的事</text><text for="L19">届时我会准备就绪 也愿意且有能力改写故事</text><text for="L20">身边明明这么多人 我却仍孤独至极</text><text for="L21">能否找到一份真切联结</text><text for="L22">能否 能否让心与心彼此相通 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(寂寞)</span></text><text for="L23">能否与谁真心相连</text><text for="L24">能否 能否找到懂我知我的人 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(形单影只)</span></text><text for="L25">我从自己的倒影里看见那份孤单</text><text for="L26">哦 能否让我与人真正相连</text><text for="L27">能否 能否寻得一份心灵相通</text><text for="L28">孤独</text><text for="L29">此刻 此刻 我要驶向另一条路</text><text for="L30">脚踩油门向前 只为寻觅真实所求</text><text for="L31">有时需要有人相伴 并不丢人</text><text for="L32">朝云端高声呼喊</text><text for="L33">我不禁问 能否与谁心意相通</text><text for="L34">能否 能否觅得一份真实联结 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(孤独)</span></text><text for="L35">能否找到与人相通的感觉</text><text for="L36">能否 能否让两颗心真正相连 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(落寞)</span></text><text for="L37">镜中倒影映出我心底的孤单</text><text for="L38">哦 能否觅得一份心灵相通</text><text for="L39">能否 能否遇见真正懂我的人</text><text for="L40">仍想找回从前的自己 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(孤单)</span></text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Connection"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="OneRepublic"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Connection - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1401489355"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM71808832"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:05.555" end="2:20.255"><p begin="0:05.555" end="0:08.795" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:05.555" end="0:05.955">These</span> <span begin="0:05.955" end="0:06.295">days</span> <span begin="0:06.295" end="0:06.625">my</span> <span begin="0:06.625" end="0:07.025">waves</span> <span begin="0:07.025" end="0:07.325">get</span> <span begin="0:07.325" end="0:07.785">lost</span> <span begin="0:07.785" end="0:07.975">in</span> <span begin="0:07.975" end="0:08.165">the</span> <span begin="0:08.165" end="0:08.795">oceans</span></p><p begin="0:08.795" end="0:11.645" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.795" end="0:08.985">Sev</span><span begin="0:08.985" end="0:09.175">en</span> <span begin="0:09.175" end="0:09.305">bil</span><span begin="0:09.305" end="0:09.495">lion</span> <span begin="0:09.495" end="0:09.705">swim</span><span begin="0:09.705" end="0:09.885">mers,</span> <span begin="0:09.885" end="0:10.135">man</span> <span begin="0:10.135" end="0:10.265">I'm</span> <span begin="0:10.265" end="0:10.465">go</span><span begin="0:10.465" end="0:10.585">ing</span> <span begin="0:10.585" end="0:10.795">through</span> <span begin="0:10.795" end="0:10.875">the</span> <span begin="0:10.875" end="0:11.175">mo</span><span begin="0:11.175" end="0:11.645">tions</span></p><p begin="0:11.635" end="0:14.475" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:11.635" end="0:12.055">Sent</span> <span begin="0:12.055" end="0:12.265">up</span> <span begin="0:12.265" end="0:12.305">a</span> <span begin="0:12.305" end="0:12.665">flare,</span> <span begin="0:12.665" end="0:12.755">I</span> <span begin="0:12.755" end="0:13.105">need</span> <span begin="0:13.105" end="0:13.465">love</span> <span begin="0:13.465" end="0:13.695">and</span> <span begin="0:13.695" end="0:13.805">de</span><span begin="0:13.805" end="0:14.095">vo</span><span begin="0:14.095" end="0:14.475">tion</span></p><p begin="0:14.475" end="0:17.355" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.475" end="0:14.725">Trad</span><span begin="0:14.725" end="0:14.825">ed</span> <span begin="0:14.825" end="0:15.015">for</span> <span begin="0:15.015" end="0:15.205">some</span> <span begin="0:15.205" end="0:15.615">faces</span> <span begin="0:15.615" end="0:15.825">that</span> <span begin="0:15.825" end="0:15.925">I</span> <span begin="0:15.925" end="0:16.125">nev</span><span begin="0:16.125" end="0:16.245">er</span> <span begin="0:16.245" end="0:16.565">know,</span> <span begin="0:16.665" end="0:16.925">no</span><span begin="0:16.925" end="0:17.355">tion</span></p><p begin="0:17.365" end="0:19.525" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.365" end="0:17.795">Maybe</span> <span begin="0:17.795" end="0:17.885">I</span> <span begin="0:17.885" end="0:18.075">should</span> <span begin="0:18.075" end="0:18.335">try</span> <span begin="0:18.335" end="0:18.405">to</span> <span begin="0:18.405" end="0:18.715">find</span> <span begin="0:18.715" end="0:18.845">the</span> <span begin="0:18.845" end="0:19.195">old</span> <span begin="0:19.