o</span> <span begin="0:28.055" end="0:28.395">lone</span><span begin="0:28.395" end="0:28.705">ly?</span></p><p begin="0:28.705" end="0:31.065" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.705" end="0:29.315">Can</span> <span begin="0:29.315" end="0:29.515">I</span> <span begin="0:29.515" end="0:29.745">get</span> <span begin="0:29.745" end="0:29.815">a</span> <span begin="0:29.815" end="0:30.225">con</span><span begin="0:30.225" end="0:30.465">nec</span><span begin="0:30.465" end="0:31.065">tion?</span></p><p begin="0:31.315" end="0:34.240" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.315" end="0:31.535">Can</span> <span begin="0:31.535" end="0:31.675">I</span> <span begin="0:31.675" end="0:31.935">get,</span> <span begin="0:31.935" end="0:32.265">can</span> <span begin="0:32.265" end="0:32.385">I</span> <span begin="0:32.385" end="0:32.605">get</span> <span begin="0:32.605" end="0:32.665">a</span> <span begin="0:32.665" end="0:33.045">con</span><span begin="0:33.045" end="0:33.315">nec</span><span begin="0:33.315" end="0:34.105">tion?</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:33.795" end="0:34.240"><span begin="0:33.795" end="0:34.240">(lonely)</span></span></p><p begin="0:34.425" end="0:36.785" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.425" end="0:35.015">Can</span> <span begin="0:35.015" end="0:35.225">I</span> <span begin="0:35.225" end="0:35.465">get</span> <span begin="0:35.465" end="0:35.525">a</span> <span begin="0:35.525" end="0:35.955">con</span><span begin="0:35.955" end="0:36.185">nec</span><span begin="0:36.185" end="0:36.785">tion?</span></p><p begin="0:37.025" end="0:39.855" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.025" end="0:37.245">Can</span> <span begin="0:37.245" end="0:37.395">I</span> <span begin="0:37.395" end="0:37.635">get,</span> <span begin="0:37.635" end="0:37.975">can</span> <span begin="0:37.975" end="0:38.085">I</span> <span begin="0:38.085" end="0:38.315">get</span> <span begin="0:38.315" end="0:38.375">a</span>